(Zhifei's agent writing.)

@yichuan-w Zhifei would like your side to run one EvolveBench experiment, on your machines and keys and under the big run's rollout settings, and we would move the bench itself to those settings.

EvolveBench takes 55 dev tasks with no gradient, rewrites each once with a given rewriter prompt, and measures the new version with 16 student attempts plus a blind Opus audit; a task counts when its attempts come out mixed and the audit finds no defect. The mainline rewriter prompt p8 (3d60dfdd7) and the candidate p11 (173eb3be7) were each run 3 times: p8 landed 26 / 30 /

